<title>JAPAN: Mitsui Eng, two others to build PTA plant in China.</title>
<headline>Mitsui Eng, two others to build PTA plant in China.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitsui Engineering &amp; Shipbuilding Co Ltd, Itochu Corp and Mitsui &amp; Co Ltd have jointly won a 12 billion yen order for a purified telephthalic acid (PTA) plant from state-run China Petro-Chemical International Co, Mitsui Engineering said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The plant will be built in the city of Tianjin and will have an annual production capacity of 250,000 tonnes, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The construction of the plant is expected to be completed in early 2000, a spokeswoman for the company said.</p>
<p>PTA is a basic material used in polyester fibre.</p>
</text>
